    "factsheet": [
        {
            "heading": "Short Description",
            "paragraphs": [
                "The Avery Hill Winter Garden is a remarkable Victorian glasshouse set within the historic Avery Hill estate in southeast London. Built in the late 19th century, it was once home to an extensive collection of exotic plants and remains one of London’s largest surviving Victorian winter gardens. Visitors can explore its striking architecture, learn about its fascinating history and restoration, and enjoy this unique heritage landmark in its beautiful parkland setting."
            ]
        }
